    {
      "uid": "zhcn:443a111752a4075b7e3d8f6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在闪耀系列赛的经典级要加油喔。\n我会以苫小牧市民，\n跟一名粉丝的身份支持您！",
      "source_fingerprint": "463120d40a93021c3c06f9650ff537fdde778a3daf0131e65f96a6a1d9ac5da0",
