      "uid": "zhcn:55f14cdcf39c2e973eb824bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于聚焦在直播演唱会等\n和粉丝双向互动较多的内容上，\n在地偶像活动花费的时间持续增加──",
      "source_fingerprint": "99b89a6fcdff44b5629cf114589934af17386153ed98de68711f09171a71f5b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
