      "uid": "zhcn:9589bd4f6ccae8f15535175a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我推算了好几次，\n按照现在的活动方针，就算粉丝的基数增加，\n似乎也没办法达到宣传苫小牧的效果……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc3a45db38ec17d2439c894b0e83ebf1b1d1bfd7c34d76e09bd5bd927a2eff7e",
