      "uid": "zhcn:4ffbf3dfeb7d5a5012746b15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……苫小牧的人们很温柔。\n只要北港火山说了“想这么做”，\n他们应该就会认同并支持她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "500e4333d330356450721a0f78edec1adbed8d6c995a993234d8102cd1340920",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
